WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.625
Towa and Setsuna.

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.583
Between us half-demon twins,
two different worlds exist at the same time.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.458
Human and demon.

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.500
Feudal era and present day.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.208
Peacefulness and war.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:29.000
Joy and sorrow.

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.375
Dreams and reality.

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.458
One moment and eternity.

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.292
And finally, love and hate.

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:39.167
A Feudal Fairytale,
Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:43.417
We'll keep moving forward
through the hurdles of destiny!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.667
Who goes there?

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.667
See that tree over yonder.

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.667
Historically significant, yet so distasteful.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.167
Menial flies, be gone.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.333
What did you say?

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.667
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS - KONTON
What an exquisite view.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.417
Damn him.

00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:17.875
"Meifuku, the Meioju"

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.833
CORPSE DEALER

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.000
CORPSE DEALER
One of the fortresses of

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.667
a certain commander
has been destroyed.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.667
A certain commander?

00:03:27.917 --> 00:03:31.583
BOUNTY HUNTER - MOROHA
As in, one of those monkeys?

00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:32.417
No.

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:34.917
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
They keep sending soldiers to

00:03:34.917 --> 00:03:36.625
survey the situation, but none return.

00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:41.250
They think this might be the work of demons,
so they came to me.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.333
SETSUNA           TOWA HIGURASHI
So, how about it?

00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:44.542
SETSUNA           TOWA HIGURASHI
That depends on the payment.

00:03:44.917 --> 00:03:50.125
If you slay the demons, the commander
will pay one thousand mon coins.

00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:51.208
I'm in.

00:03:51.208 --> 00:03:52.417
Takechiyo.

00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:54.500
Go ahead and take them there.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.875
TAKECHIYO
Yep.

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:57.125
Okay, let's go.

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:02.208
Hey, what's wrong?
Come on, let's go.

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:06.417
Setsuna and I aren't really interested
in bounty hunting.

00:04:06.417 --> 00:04:07.708
You aren't interested?!

00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:11.750
But it's one thousand mon.
That's a year's worth of rice!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.250
You can eat that by yourself.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:18.208
Yeah, I'll eat all that rice
on my own... Not!

00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:19.833
Just come with me already!

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:22.417
--Let's just split up for today.
--Why?

00:04:23.958 --> 00:04:26.417
We have different goals, or something?

00:04:26.417 --> 00:04:27.458
What does that even mean?

00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:30.375
Why must we go with you
in the first place?

00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:35.500
Well, that's because, uh...
because we're comrades?

00:04:35.917 --> 00:04:36.833
Comrades?

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:41.167
Demon slaying and bounty hunting
are different things.

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:47.083
Fine, be that way!
I can take care of this job all by myself.

00:04:47.417 --> 00:04:51.875
Damn you, you bunch of dummies.
Your mama's a human!

00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:55.583
Yours is too.

00:04:56.042 --> 00:04:57.417
Come on, Takechiyo.

00:04:57.417 --> 00:05:01.500
Hey, you're going the wrong way,
it's that way!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.625
So?

00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:06.292
Did you find out anything
about the Dream Butterfly?

00:05:06.292 --> 00:05:07.833
Enough of that already.

00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:09.000
But I have to.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:13.833
I came to this world to get your dreams
back from the Dream Butterfly.

00:05:14.167 --> 00:05:16.292
As usual, I don't have anything.

00:05:16.292 --> 00:05:18.000
- Not even a little?
- Sorry.

00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:22.625
But if you really want results,
why not put out a bounty for it?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.917
That is how my business works, after all.

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:32.125
A client pays money,
and someone fulfills their request.

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:38.208
If you put a bounty out for the Dream Butterfly,
I'm sure someone will go look for it.

00:05:38.208 --> 00:05:40.125
How much would I have to pay?

00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:41.667
Towa, stop it.

00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:44.667
A Dream Butterfly would be
one thousand mon.

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:45.917
One thousand mon?

00:05:45.917 --> 00:05:47.458
A year's worth of rice.

00:05:47.458 --> 00:05:49.958
One koku, a year's worth, is ten tou,

00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:52.417
one hundred shou,
or one thousand gou.

00:05:52.417 --> 00:05:54.917
Wait, how many kilograms
is a thousand gou?

00:05:54.917 --> 00:05:56.833
It's quite the amount.

00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.542
So do you have a bounty
that would fetch me that price?

00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:05.417
For now, there's only
that one job I gave to Moroha.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.250
You can't be serious...

00:06:10.917 --> 00:06:12.833
Geez, what's with them?

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:16.000
I was just thinking that since we're cousins,

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.792
I'd try to get along with them
like relatives normally would.

00:06:20.292 --> 00:06:22.750
But then I get treated like that.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:29.667
And here I was, finally thinking
that I'd made some friends,

00:06:30.417 --> 00:06:33.917
since I've been all alone
this whole time, so...

00:06:35.417 --> 00:06:37.417
You wouldn't understand.

00:06:37.417 --> 00:06:41.250
Quarter-demons have it pretty
rough if we're alone.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.250
Hey! Moroha!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.250
Wait for us!

00:06:49.417 --> 00:06:51.875
Moroha, we'll go with you!

00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:57.500
Come on, Takechiyo, let's hurry up.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.375
We're not going to wait for them?

00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:02.458
I said hurry up. Go!

00:07:03.042 --> 00:07:03.875
Wait, what?

00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:06.250
Moroha! Hey!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.667
Why did you run from us?

00:07:16.667 --> 00:07:20.833
Takechiyo just suddenly booked it,
you know? Blame him.

00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:22.833
No, I didn't...

00:07:24.542 --> 00:07:27.875
So? What did you want,
chasing after me and all?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.750
We'll help with your bounty hunting.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.792
But you said you didn't want to.

00:07:32.792 --> 00:07:34.125
Well, the thing is...

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.250
We thought about it,
and consider you a reliable friend.

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:39.667
What? Oh, really?

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.833
Let's slay demons together.

00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:45.375
Well, if you put it that way,
then I guess I have no choice!

00:07:45.375 --> 00:07:48.000
Sure, I'll bring you two along.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.625
Thanks a lot, Moroha.

00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:50.875
All right, Takechiyo.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.042
The fortress should be up ahead.

00:07:54.042 --> 00:07:56.833
I'm spent, so I'm going to head home.

00:07:56.833 --> 00:08:00.417
If you're heading back,
can you take this bicycle with you?

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:11.125
Is that it?

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:14.333
Something's here.

00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:16.958
You're right. It smells fishy, literally.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.542
Not much demon energy, though.

00:08:22.542 --> 00:08:25.500
MEIOJU'S SON - MEIFUKU

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.208
What are you doing?

00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:29.250
H-Hey.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.667
Leave him be. It's just some kid.

00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:33.583
The real thing is over there.

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:55.000
I thought it would be
another boorish group of samurai,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.958
but instead I see a trio of mysterious girls.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:02.958
Excuse me, are you the one who destroyed
the fortress that was here?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:07.833
I did not destroy it.
It was distasteful, so I simply removed it.

00:09:07.833 --> 00:09:10.458
Behold, this wonderful scenery!

00:09:10.458 --> 00:09:11.792
Yeah, it's definitely him.

00:09:12.458 --> 00:09:17.833
Girls, if you would perform a dance for me,
then I can perhaps reward you.

00:09:18.167 --> 00:09:21.958
Hah! A dance?
You've got to be kidding.

00:09:21.958 --> 00:09:23.958
You'll be the one dancing for us!

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:28.583
Moroha the Demon Killer, here to
collect the bounty on your head.

00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:34.167
Bounty? There's a bounty
on this Konton's head?

00:09:34.167 --> 00:09:36.792
Distasteful! Absolutely distasteful.

00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:38.333
Konton?

00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:40.750
So he's Kirinmaru's underling?

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:44.292
To run into him in this situation...
What should we do?

00:09:44.292 --> 00:09:46.000
We'll take him down, obviously.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.500
Watch out!

00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:52.333
WIND LION           THUNDER LION

00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:58.083
Half-demons. I will not go easy on you.

00:10:12.458 --> 00:10:16.125
You think you can keep parrying like that?
Your belly's wide open.

00:10:19.292 --> 00:10:20.375
Moroha!

00:10:21.917 --> 00:10:26.167
Kurikaramaru couldn't cut through it?
What kind of demon magic is this?

00:10:26.167 --> 00:10:29.375
If so, I'll absorb the demon power.

00:10:33.625 --> 00:10:35.125
I can't absorb its power?

00:10:37.625 --> 00:10:40.208
This is not a matter
of demon energy or demon magic.

00:10:40.208 --> 00:10:45.083
This is an especially sturdy armor, and will not
crack from any hit it takes.

00:10:45.083 --> 00:10:48.083
Not even a diamond will pierce through.

00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:53.167
And behold this divine sword
from ancient times.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:04.583
Do not put me in the same league
as this country's demons.

00:11:16.292 --> 00:11:18.500
How dare you, so distasteful.

00:11:21.292 --> 00:11:21.792
After them.

00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:39.625
Where is this...

00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:43.292
More importantly,
who the heck is this shrimp here?

00:11:43.292 --> 00:11:48.000
Moroha, you're being rude.
Remember, he saved us.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.250
We saw each other earlier, right?
What's your name?

00:11:51.833 --> 00:11:55.458
My name is Meifuku. I'm a Meioju.

00:11:55.875 --> 00:12:02.208
Meioju. Your kind sports the
sturdiest shell among all the demons.

00:12:02.208 --> 00:12:04.125
The sturdiest? You don't mean...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.250
Please look over there.

00:12:10.542 --> 00:12:12.750
Whoa, what the hell?

00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:16.083
Man, that's a huge creature.

00:12:16.083 --> 00:12:19.292
Are these the bones of a demon?

00:12:19.292 --> 00:12:21.417
The remains of my father.

00:12:22.083 --> 00:12:24.792
My father was quite
the exceptional demon,

00:12:24.792 --> 00:12:28.417
but Konton had laid a trap
using a strange spell.

00:12:32.833 --> 00:12:36.333
GREAT DEMON WITH THE
ULTIMATE ARMORED SHELL - MEIOJU

00:12:38.208 --> 00:12:40.583
How distasteful. Take this!

00:12:42.917 --> 00:12:46.000
Nothing can pierce my armored shell.

00:12:47.375 --> 00:12:49.000
Dark Lightning Cannon!

00:12:52.417 --> 00:12:56.000
Did you think you could defeat this Meioju?

00:13:04.375 --> 00:13:08.542
I laid out an immobilizing field.
You can no longer move.

00:13:22.542 --> 00:13:26.667
I have now acquired Meioju's armored shell.

00:13:27.042 --> 00:13:29.667
Damn you.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.750
F-Father!

00:13:37.542 --> 00:13:39.667
Run, Meifuku!

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:51.292
Konton killed my father
and took his armored shell.

00:13:51.833 --> 00:13:56.250
He used that shell
to create a suit of armor.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.250
So that's what that suit of armor is.

00:13:58.708 --> 00:14:02.333
But how do you shape an
armored shell into a suit of armor?

00:14:05.125 --> 00:14:06.333
Grandpa Myoga?

00:14:06.333 --> 00:14:07.708
FLEA DEMON - MYOGA
I live!

00:14:07.708 --> 00:14:10.083
FLEA DEMON - MYOGA
Konton and the other Four Perils

00:14:10.083 --> 00:14:11.708
are from the mainland,

00:14:11.708 --> 00:14:16.250
so the spells they use are similar
to Tao magic and Fang magic.

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:18.500
Oh, you researched it?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.708
Konton probably extracted
the shell's demon energy,

00:14:21.708 --> 00:14:25.375
and used a spell technique to
mold it into a suit of armor.

00:14:26.083 --> 00:14:29.917
I was just so focused
on running away back then.

00:14:30.417 --> 00:14:32.958
I don't want to leave things as they are.

00:14:32.958 --> 00:14:36.708
I wish to avenge my father,
so I've been following Konton around.

00:14:37.292 --> 00:14:38.292
But...

00:14:38.667 --> 00:14:41.042
I don't think I can win at all.

00:14:41.042 --> 00:14:46.042
If I could at least take back my father's shell
and send him off properly...

00:14:46.042 --> 00:14:48.208
How long have you been
following him around?

00:14:48.208 --> 00:14:49.667
Maybe around ten years.

00:14:49.667 --> 00:14:51.500
Ten years? That's too long.

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.417
But I'm just barely fifty years old.

00:14:54.417 --> 00:14:57.667
You're older than me?
You're fifty years old?!

00:14:57.667 --> 00:15:01.667
I'm so young that my
armored shell is only a single layer.

00:15:01.667 --> 00:15:04.250
If fifty's not enough,
how much longer do you need?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.500
Ideally, another fifty years...

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.500
You're kidding me.

00:15:08.833 --> 00:15:11.792
- Your armored shell is sturdy enough!
- Please stop!

00:15:11.792 --> 00:15:14.167
Remove it, I'll use it instead.

00:15:14.958 --> 00:15:17.125
It's not something I can just remove!

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:18.708
I can't! It's impossible!

00:15:18.708 --> 00:15:21.167
Then stand in front of me
and become my shield.

00:15:21.167 --> 00:15:22.375
I'd rather not!

00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:24.083
They've caught up to us.

00:15:30.625 --> 00:15:31.750
Is it just the pets?

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.167
Konton.

00:15:39.708 --> 00:15:41.917
It is indeed a strange spell.

00:15:41.917 --> 00:15:44.708
Grandpa Myoga,
it might be better if you hid.

00:15:44.708 --> 00:15:46.208
Here I go, goodbye!

00:15:47.042 --> 00:15:50.042
So it's Meioju's little brat.

00:15:50.042 --> 00:15:52.458
After all this time,
you still bare your fangs at me?

00:15:52.917 --> 00:15:56.000
I... um...

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:00.833
You betcha! Meifuku here says
he's going to beat you and take his revenge.

00:16:01.208 --> 00:16:03.875
I see. Vengeance, is it?

00:16:03.875 --> 00:16:05.208
But I'm not ready...

00:16:05.208 --> 00:16:08.875
Go on! Tell him you want
your dad's armored shell back.

00:16:08.875 --> 00:16:11.458
Well, yes, I would like to do that one day.

00:16:13.375 --> 00:16:15.500
Are you saying that
you can defeat me?

00:16:16.958 --> 00:16:20.708
Don't worry about it, we'll help you out.

00:16:20.708 --> 00:16:23.250
We'll defeat him and
get one thousand mon coins.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.458
Even better, if we take his head back,
we can get a gold ingot!

00:16:26.458 --> 00:16:28.292
So here, go on now!

00:16:30.042 --> 00:16:33.958
I'll avenge my father... So Konton...

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:42.042
Geez, you're so helpless.
Just become my shield, then.

00:16:42.042 --> 00:16:43.667
O-Okay.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.292
Huh? Me?

00:16:48.292 --> 00:16:49.417
Hey, you.

00:16:49.417 --> 00:16:53.167
That person is scary,
so I'll just be your armor, okay?

00:17:02.292 --> 00:17:04.333
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.875
Moroha!

00:17:15.083 --> 00:17:16.750
Cyclone Burst!

00:17:19.792 --> 00:17:20.417
What?

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.083
Divine Speed.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.542
Setsuna!

00:17:32.958 --> 00:17:33.750
Setsuna!

00:17:34.167 --> 00:17:36.333
It can't be helped. It's come to this.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:43.125
With this rouge, I become
Beniyasha, Destroyer of Lands!

00:17:43.125 --> 00:17:45.083
Tremble before the bloodthirsty dawn!

00:17:45.083 --> 00:17:46.083
Divine Speed.

00:17:48.667 --> 00:17:49.708
Moroha!

00:17:49.708 --> 00:17:50.875
Divine Speed!

00:17:54.458 --> 00:17:56.958
Your armored shell's doing its job!

00:17:56.958 --> 00:17:59.167
All right, let's go all at once.

00:18:09.167 --> 00:18:13.083
Meifuku, your armored shell
is just as sturdy as your dad's!

00:18:13.417 --> 00:18:16.500
This is nothing compared to my father's.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:20.750
Even with its demon energy removed,
his is still just as sturdy.

00:18:21.208 --> 00:18:23.500
So its demon energy was removed, huh?

00:18:25.125 --> 00:18:26.292
Exploding field!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.167
Towa!

00:18:35.417 --> 00:18:38.250
You must know you cannot
absorb its demon energy!

00:18:38.792 --> 00:18:41.708
Yeah, that armored shell
doesn't have any demon energy.

00:18:42.375 --> 00:18:44.500
So I'll give you...

00:18:45.125 --> 00:18:46.667
some of mine!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:56.000
Damn you, Konton! Damn you!

00:18:56.375 --> 00:18:57.250
Father?

00:18:59.042 --> 00:19:00.208
Divine Speed!

00:19:03.917 --> 00:19:08.208
Meifuku. My dear Meifuku.
Fire a Dark Lightning Cannon.

00:19:08.583 --> 00:19:11.583
Father! It's really you, isn't it?

00:19:11.833 --> 00:19:15.208
But my Dark Lightning Cannon is still...

00:19:15.208 --> 00:19:16.708
It'll be fine.

00:19:17.417 --> 00:19:20.917
From this distance,
your Dark Lightning Cannon will be enough.

00:19:20.917 --> 00:19:23.458
But then, Father, you'll get...

00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:26.375
Please, put your father at ease, Meifuku.

00:19:26.625 --> 00:19:28.125
I will not allow it! Exploding field!

00:19:28.458 --> 00:19:29.542
Oh, no.

00:19:32.167 --> 00:19:32.708
What?

00:19:33.333 --> 00:19:35.333
Don't you dare.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.375
How distasteful.

00:19:40.333 --> 00:19:43.583
Now, Meifuku.
Fire your Dark Lightning Cannon!

00:19:44.125 --> 00:19:45.542
Father...

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:49.042
Dark Lightning Cannon!

00:19:52.375 --> 00:19:53.417
Now!

00:20:06.208 --> 00:20:07.542
Father!

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.750
You did well, Meifuku.

00:20:11.667 --> 00:20:13.000
Father...

00:20:18.875 --> 00:20:23.875
You managed to steal away my armor,
but you've exhausted your demon energy.

00:20:24.417 --> 00:20:26.000
Now die!

00:20:27.125 --> 00:20:29.292
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:20:31.583 --> 00:20:33.250
Cyclone Burst!

00:20:41.583 --> 00:20:43.583
D-Damn you.

00:20:43.583 --> 00:20:45.458
Now I've got you!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.083
He got away.

00:20:52.458 --> 00:20:55.417
I see. What a troublesome spell.

00:20:56.917 --> 00:20:59.000
Thanks, you two.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.167
Are you all right?

00:21:00.167 --> 00:21:02.875
I think I used a bit too much demon energy.

00:21:02.875 --> 00:21:04.250
Lady Moroha.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.583
It's right here.

00:21:08.042 --> 00:21:10.083
Please don't forget it.

00:21:21.917 --> 00:21:25.875
Thanks to you, I was able
to get back my father's armored shell.

00:21:25.875 --> 00:21:29.125
For now, I'll be praying
for the departed souls.

00:21:29.125 --> 00:21:31.625
Just out of curiosity,
how long will you do that for?

00:21:34.458 --> 00:21:36.000
For about fifty years.

00:21:40.417 --> 00:21:44.125
I still can't believe Konton got away.

00:21:44.125 --> 00:21:46.375
Looks like you can't collect your bounty.

00:21:46.375 --> 00:21:48.417
What? But we chased him away.

00:21:48.417 --> 00:21:51.750
We can't collect the bounty
unless we have his head!

00:22:05.833 --> 00:22:09.958
Damn it all. Things will not end like this.

00:22:10.875 --> 00:22:12.500
Curse you half-demons.

00:23:43.875 --> 00:23:46.917
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW
Kinka and Ginka, demon brothers born conjoined.

00:23:46.917 --> 00:23:52.250
The stronger consumes the weaker,
and evolves into one powerful demon.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:56.833
It's eat or be eaten!
We only part when one of us dies.

00:23:56.833 --> 00:24:02.167
They possess me and Setsuna,
and steal the Rainbow Pearls in our eyes!

00:24:02.167 --> 00:24:05.292
Next time on Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:
"The Gold and Silver Rainbow Pearls"

00:24:05.292 --> 00:24:22.976
I applaud you for stealing those. Now I can
get my revenge on Sesshomaru.
